WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
There are thousands of
daisies on the school field.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.830
You've got one lesson
to find out how many.

3
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.290
You can't possibly count every
single one before the bell.

4
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.490
So how can you get a fair estimate,
without counting them all?

5
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.970
In this mission, you'll
meet the quadrat,

6
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.770
a simple square frame,

7
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.240
and find out why where you
put it matters so much.

8
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.630
You'll learn how to turn a
handful of small counts into an

9
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.450
estimate for the whole field.

10
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.830
And you'll use a transect to see
how a species changes from one

11
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.150
side of a habitat to the other.

12
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.270
Your mission: estimate the
daisies on the field without

13
00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.100
counting every one.
